<slide>
  theme: sunset
</slide>

## A custom theme: `sunset`

Defined once under `themes` in this deck's `deck.json` and used here with `theme: sunset`.
It also joins the **t** key cycle.

<code lang=typescript id=g1 class=left>
  <frame>
    const theme = {
      name: "sunset",
      warm: true,
    };
  </frame>
  <frame>
    const theme = {
      name: "sunset",
      warm: true,
      accent: "#ff9e64",
    };
  </frame>
</code>
